menu "Battery test control"

    config TEST_CONTROL_AVERAGING_LENGTH
        int "EBC frames averaged into one stored measurement"
        range 1 120
        default 20
        help
            The EBC sends about one status frame per second. Current, voltage and
            capacity of this many frames are averaged before a measurement is stored.
            A mode, step, cycle or setpoint change always starts a new average.

endmenu
